<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Praxair cut to sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Praxair cut to sell.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber has cut its rating for Praxair Inc to sell from neutral, a market source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The company closed at 47-5/8 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
